# CODEOWNERS — who reviews what.
#
# GitHub uses this file for the "Require review from Code Owners" branch-protection
# rule on `main`. A PR touching a path below cannot merge until its owner approves.
# Flow and branch-protection setup: see CONTRIBUTING.md.
#
# Syntax:  <path-pattern>   <@user | @org/team | email>
# Docs:    https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# IMPORTANT: the @handles below are PLACEHOLDERS — swap in each teammate's real
# GitHub username. A handle GitHub can't resolve is silently ignored, and that
# path will then require no code-owner review.

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
